id: mass-construction
name: Mass Construction
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score 8+
tpCost: 3
# How many Features, asked as it is used - 1(T) more KP for each after the first; their Squares said on the card.
forgeMany: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  World Forging makes several Features, covering up to 1/2 your Might in Squares - 1(T) more KP for each after the first.
text: >
  Mass Construction: You can create multiple pieces of terrain at once.
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score 8+
  –TP Cost: 3
  –Effect: You can make Features that cover Squares up to 1/2 of your Might. For each Feature you make after the first,
  increase the Ki Point Cost of World Forging by 1(T).
